      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @{59cb4676d4edc012b9dca22f|full_name}, trying to understand this more.\n\nFrom our understanding, isn’t avatar bounding box authored by the creator? It has a default based on the imported rest pose (probably Tpose in this case) but you can just edit it.\n\nDo you know if you are able to tweak the bounding box in unity?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
